  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VeloBank Poland Equity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On August 1, 2024, the EBRD completed an equity co-investment in VeloBank SA  (&quot;VeloBank&quot;), alongside Cerberus and the IFC in furtherance to a competitive  sale process. The investment is carried out through a holding company  established in the Netherlands. EBRD&apos;s stake is 9.90%. VeloBank was majority  owned by the Polish Resolution Authority, Bank Guarantee Fund (&quot;BFG&quot;) following  the successful resolution process completed in September 2022.  The Project supports the successful resolution of a medium-sized bank in Poland  and an increase in private ownership in the Polish banking sector.</narrative>
  </description>
